---
layout: base.njk
title: EC Operations Manual | Leap
description: A practical, structured knowledge base for e-commerce operators — covering store setup, inventory, logistics, marketing, customer support, and cross-border EC.
---

<!-- ▼ Hero Section -->
<section class="section py-3xl" style="background: var(--color-primary-gradient); color: var(--color-white);">
    <div class="container text-center">
        <span class="text-white font-bold mb-sm d-block" style="opacity: 0.9; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Leap Knowledge Base</span>
        <h1 class="text-white mb-md">EC Operations Manual</h1>
        <p class="text-white mb-xl" style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); max-width: 800px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
            From store setup and inventory management to logistics, marketing,<br>
            customer support, and cross-border EC — practical know-how for every e-commerce operator.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ▼ Category Cards -->
<section class="section bg-white" style="position: relative; margin-top: -60px; padding-top: var(--space-lg); padding-bottom: var(--space-3xl);">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="flex justify-end mb-md" style="position: relative; z-index: 10;">
            <a href="/{{ locale }}/ec-guide/list/" class="view-all-link">
                See all articles &rarr;
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3" style="gap: 20px;">

            <!-- 1. Store Setup -->
            <a href="/{{ locale }}/ec-guide/store-setup/" class="manual-card">
                <div class="icon-box">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" style="width:32px; height:32px; color: var(--color-primary-start);"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 21v-7.5a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h3a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75V21m-4.5 0H2.36m11.14 0H18m0 0h3.64m-1.39 0V9.349M3.75 21V9.349m0 0a3.001 3.001 0 0 0 3.75-.615A2.993 2.993 0 0 0 9.75 9.75c.896 0 1.7-.393 2.25-1.016a2.993 2.993 0 0 0 2.25 1.016 2.993 2.993 0 0 0 2.25-1.016 3.001 3.001 0 0 0 3.75.614m-16.5 0a3.004 3.004 0 0 1-.621-4.72l1.189-1.19A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5.378 3h13.243a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.06.44l1.19 1.189a3 3 0 0 1-.621 4.72M6.75 18h3.75a.75.75 0 0 0 .75-.75V13.5a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75H6.75a.75.75 0 0 0-.75.75v3.75c0 .414.336.75.75.75Z" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h2 class="manual-title">{{ ec_topic_translation['store-setup'][locale] }}</h2>
                <p class="manual-desc">Platform selection, initial configuration, and store design — everything you need to launch your EC store.</p>
                <span class="manual-link">View articles &rarr;</span>
            </a>

            <!-- 2. Product & Inventory -->
            <a href="/{{ locale }}/ec-guide/inventory/" class="manual-card">
                <div class="icon-box">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" style="width:32px; height:32px; color: var(--color-primary-start);"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m20.25 7.5-.625 10.632a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.247 2.118H6.622a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.247-2.118L3.75 7.5M10 11.25h4M3.375 7.5h17.25c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125v-1.5c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125H3.375c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v1.5c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125Z" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h2 class="manual-title">{{ ec_topic_translation['inventory'][locale] }}</h2>
                <p class="manual-desc">Streamline product listing, copywriting, pricing, and stock management to maximize sales opportunities.</p>
                <span class="manual-link">View articles &rarr;</span>
            </a>

            <!-- 3. Logistics & Shipping -->
            <a href="/{{ locale }}/ec-guide/logistics/" class="manual-card">
                <div class="icon-box">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" style="width:32px; height:32px; color: var(--color-primary-start);"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.25 18.75a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-3 0m3 0h6m-9 0H3.375a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125V14.25m17.25 4.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-3 0m3 0h1.125c.621 0 1.129-.504 1.09-1.124a17.902 17.902 0 0 0-3.213-9.193 2.056 2.056 0 0 0-1.58-.86H14.25M16.5 18.75h-2.25m0-11.177v-.958c0-.568-.422-1.048-.987-1.106a48.554 48.554 0 0 0-10.026 0 1.106 1.106 0 0 0-.987 1.106v7.635m12-6.677v6.677m0 4.5v-4.5m0 0h-12" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h2 class="manual-title">{{ ec_topic_translation['logistics'][locale] }}</h2>
                <p class="manual-desc">Fulfillment workflows, packaging, returns, and carrier selection — cut costs while improving customer satisfaction.</p>
                <span class="manual-link">View articles &rarr;</span>
            </a>

            <!-- 4. Marketing & Advertising -->
            <a href="/{{ locale }}/ec-guide/marketing/" class="manual-card">
                <div class="icon-box">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" style="width:32px; height:32px; color: var(--color-primary-start);"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.34 15.84c-.688-.06-1.386-.09-2.09-.09H7.5a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0-9h.75c.704 0 1.402-.03 2.09-.09m0 9.18c.253.962.584 1.892.985 2.783.247.55.06 1.21-.463 1.511l-.657.38c-.551.318-1.26.117-1.527-.461a20.845 20.845 0 0 1-1.44-4.282m3.102.069a18.03 18.03 0 0 1-.59-4.59c0-1.586.205-3.124.59-4.59m0 9.18a23.848 23.848 0 0 1 8.835 2.535M10.34 6.66a23.847 23.847 0 0 1 8.835-2.535m0 0A23.74 23.74 0 0 0 18.795 3m.38 1.125a23.91 23.91 0 0 1 1.014 5.795 23.944 23.944 0 0 1-1.014 5.795m-3.8-11.58a23.917 23.917 0 0 0-4.636 2.02" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h2 class="manual-title">{{ ec_topic_translation['marketing'][locale] }}</h2>
                <p class="manual-desc">SEO, social media, paid ads, and email marketing strategies to maximize traffic and conversions.</p>
                <span class="manual-link">View articles &rarr;</span>
            </a>

            <!-- 5. Customer Support -->
            <a href="/{{ locale }}/ec-guide/customer-support/" class="manual-card">
                <div class="icon-box">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" style="width:32px; height:32px; color: var(--color-primary-start);"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M20.25 8.511c.884.284 1.5 1.128 1.5 2.097v4.286c0 1.136-.847 2.1-1.98 2.193-.34.027-.68.052-1.02.072v3.091l-3-3c-1.354 0-2.694-.055-4.02-.163a2.115 2.115 0 0 1-.825-.242m9.345-8.334a2.126 2.126 0 0 0-.476-.095 48.64 48.64 0 0 0-8.048 0c-1.131.094-1.976 1.057-1.976 2.192v4.286c0 .837.46 1.58 1.155 1.951m9.345-8.334V6.637c0-1.621-1.152-3.026-2.76-3.235A48.455 48.455 0 0 0 11.25 3c-2.115 0-4.198.137-6.24.402-1.608.209-2.76 1.614-2.76 3.235v6.226c0 1.621 1.152 3.026 2.76 3.235.577.075 1.157.14 1.74.194V21l4.155-4.155" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h2 class="manual-title">{{ ec_topic_translation['customer-support'][locale] }}</h2>
                <p class="manual-desc">Review management, complaint handling, and repeat-buyer strategies to boost customer satisfaction.</p>
                <span class="manual-link">View articles &rarr;</span>
            </a>

            <!-- 6. Cross-border EC -->
            <a href="/{{ locale }}/ec-guide/cross-border/" class="manual-card">
                <div class="icon-box">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" style="width:32px; height:32px; color: var(--color-primary-start);"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 0 0 8.716-6.747M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 0 1-8.716-6.747M12 21c2.485 0 4.5-4.03 4.5-9S14.485 3 12 3m0 18c-2.485 0-4.5-4.03-4.5-9S9.515 3 12 3m0 0a8.997 8.997 0 0 1 7.843 4.582M12 3a8.997 8.997 0 0 0-7.843 4.582m15.686 0A11.953 11.953 0 0 1 12 10.5c-2.998 0-5.74-1.1-7.843-2.918m15.686 0A8.959 8.959 0 0 1 21 12c0 .778-.099 1.533-.284 2.253m0 0A17.919 17.919 0 0 1 12 16.5c-3.162 0-6.133-.815-8.716-2.247m0 0A9.015 9.015 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.605.42-3.113 1.157-4.418" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h2 class="manual-title">{{ ec_topic_translation['cross-border'][locale] }}</h2>
                <p class="manual-desc">Multilingual support, international shipping, customs, and local payment methods — your guide to selling across borders.</p>
                <span class="manual-link">View articles &rarr;</span>
            </a>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ▼ Latest Articles -->
<section id="latest-articles-section" class="section py-xl bg-beige">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-lg" style="width: 100%; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px;">
            <h2 id="section-title" class="text-xl font-bold" style="border-left: 5px solid var(--color-primary-start); padding-left: 15px;">Latest Articles</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3" id="posts-container">
            {% set displayed_count = 0 %}

            {% for post in collections['ec-guide'] | reverse %}
                {% if post.data.locale and post.data.locale == locale %}

                    {% set topic_label = ec_topic_translation[post.data.topic][locale] %}
                    {% if not topic_label %}
                        {% set topic_label = post.data.topic_label | default(post.data.topic) %}
                    {% endif %}

                    <article class="card p-0 blog-item"
                             data-tags="{{ post.data.tags | join(',') }}"
                             style="padding: 0; overflow: hidden; display: {% if displayed_count < 6 %}flex{% else %}none{% endif %}; flex-direction: column; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); box-shadow: none; background: white; border-radius: 8px; transition: transform 0.2s;">

                        <a href="{{ post.url }}" style="display: block; aspect-ratio: 16/9; overflow: hidden;">
                            <img src="{{ post.data.thumbnail | default('https://placehold.co/600x400/f1f5f9/94a3b8?text=No+Image') }}"
                                 alt="{{ post.data.title }}"
                                 style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.3s;">
                        </a>

                        <div class="px-lg py-lg flex-col" style="flex: 1; display: flex;">
                            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-sm">
                                <span class="text-primary font-bold" style="font-size: 12px; background: rgba(193, 0, 51, 0.1); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px;">
                                    {{ topic_label }}
                                </span>
                                <time style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
                                    {{ post.date | date("yyyy.MM.dd") }}
                                </time>
                            </div>

                            <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); line-height: 1.4; font-weight: bold;">
                                <a href="{{ post.url }}" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;">
                                    {{ post.data.title }}
                                </a>
                            </h3>

                            <p class="text-secondary mb-lg" style="flex: 1; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; overflow: hidden; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; -webkit-line-clamp: 2;">
                                {{ post.data.description }}
                            </p>

                            <div class="flex items-center pt-sm" style="border-top: 1px solid #eee;">
                                <div style="width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ccc; margin-right: 8px; overflow: hidden;">
                                    <img src="{{ post.data.author_image | default('https://placehold.co/100x100/ddd/fff?text=User') }}" alt="author" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;">
                                </div>
                                <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: var(--color-text-primary);">
                                    {{ post.data.author | default('Leap Editorial Team') }}
                                </span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                    {% set displayed_count = displayed_count + 1 %}
                {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}

            {% if displayed_count == 0 %}
                <div class="text-center w-full py-3xl" style="grid-column: 1/-1;">
                    <p class="text-secondary">No articles available yet.</p>
                </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

{% include "cta1.njk" %}

<style>
    .view-all-link {
        color: var(--color-primary-start);
        font-weight: bold;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        transition: transform 0.2s, opacity 0.2s;
        display: inline-block;
    }
    .view-all-link:hover {
        transform: translateX(5px);
        opacity: 0.8;
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .manual-card {
        display: block;
        background: white;
        padding: 30px 20px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
        transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        text-align: center;
        height: 100%;
    }
    .manual-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        border-color: var(--color-primary-start);
    }
    .icon-box {
        background: #fff5f7;
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        margin: 0 auto 20px;
    }
    .manual-title {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        color: var(--color-text-primary);
    }
    .manual-desc {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .manual-link {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: var(--color-primary-start);
    }
    .blog-item:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08) !important;
    }
    .blog-item:hover h3 a { color: var(--color-primary-start) !important; }
</style>
